],{},"Shuo UI provides a ",[324,325,326],"strong",{},"usage skill"," that teaches AI agents to build forms and query pages with Shuo UI.",[312,329,331],{"id":330},"usage","Usage",[317,333,334],{},"The usage skill gives AI agents comprehensive knowledge about building with Shuo UI. It covers:",[336,337,338,342,345,361,364,367,374],"ul",{},[339,340,341],"li",{},"Installation and CSS setup",[339,343,344],{},"The v-model types, main props, slots and common pitfalls of all 17 components",[339,346,347,348,352,353,356,357,360],{},"Form validation with ",[349,350,351],"code",{},"UForm",", ",[349,354,355],{},"UFormField"," and Valibot, and the shared rules (",[349,358,359],{},"requiredText"," and others)",[339,362,363],{},"The empty-value contract of each component and how to initialize state",[339,365,366],{},"The query card with a result list and server-side pagination",[339,368,369,370,373],{},"The ",[349,371,372],{},"shuoUi"," module options: site-wide defaults, locales and messages, theming",[339,375,376],{},"Display utilities for dates, numbers, phones and months",[317,378,379,380,385],{},"The skill includes additional references that the AI agent loads on demand based on the task, keeping responses focused and context-efficient. When it needs a full props table or more examples, the skill points the agent to the ",[381,382,384],"a",{"href":383},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fagents\u002Fllms-txt#markdown-version-of-a-single-page","markdown version"," of the matching docs page.",[387,388,389,390,393],"note",{},"Once installed, you can invoke the skill by typing ",[349,391,392],{},"\u002Fshuo-ui"," in your agent's chat.",[395,396,398],"h3",{"id":397},"skills-cli","Skills CLI",[317,400,369,401,409],{},[381,402,406],{"href":403,"rel":404},"https:\u002F\u002Fskills.sh",[405],"nofollow",[349,407,408],{},"skills"," CLI is the easiest way to install the Shuo UI skill. It supports many agents, including Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, Windsurf and Cline.",[411,412,417],"pre",{"classN